                     <note>TBRC: W9845</note>
                     <incipit xml:lang="bo">/ces jo bo ne ser ba'i bstod pa 'phrin las myur 'grub 'di ni/ dad can 'phrin las dpal 'byor gyis nan gyis bskul ba'i ngor/ bka' bdams kyi btsun pa blo bzang chos kyi rgyal mtshan gyis/ chos grwa chen po dpal ldan 'bras spungs kyi gzims khang dga' ldan pho brang du sbyar ba'o// //sar+ba mang+ga laM//</incipit>
